    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44636" root="&#xA;                        وضع&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْضُوعٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A certain pace</i> of a beast; <i>contr. of</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْفُوعٌ</span>. (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رفع</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْضُوعٌ</span> as an inf. n.,
signifying a certain manner of going of a beast:
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَفَعَ البَعِيرُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْضُوعٌ</span>, in logic, (assumed tropical:)  <i>A
subject, as opposed to a predicate:</i> and (assumed tropical:)  <i>a substance, as opposed to an accident:</i> in each sense,
<i>contr. of</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْمُولٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  (assumed tropical:)  The <i>subject</i> of a book
or the like. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصْنُوعٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْوَاتٌ مَصُوغَةٌ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوُضُوعَةٌ</span>: see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صوغ</span>.

